---
title: "Session host: one channel across dcserver restarts, host loss and terminate"
---
stateDiagram-v2
  state "Legend" as legend {
    lg0: Recovery
    lg1: Session
    lg2: Path to the HeldInputSubmitted bug
    lg3: Repeats forever, so HeldInputSubmitted breaks
  }
  class lg0 blue
  class lg1 teal
  class lg2 bugPath
  class lg3 repeats
  s0: No session
  s1: dcserver down, nothing running
  s2: Boot reconcile (after the restart)
  s3: No session (after the restart)
  s4: No session, a message waiting (after the restart)
  s5: No session, input kept for a host (after the restart), no tmux yet
  s6: No session, input kept for a host (after the restart)
  [*] --> s0
  s0 --> s1: dcserver stops
  s1 --> s2: dcserver starts
  s2 --> s3: intake opens
  s3 --> s4: a message arrives
  s4 --> s5: no host: one notice, the message is kept
  s5 --> s6: tmux becomes usable
  s6 --> s6: a host probe stops failing
  class s0 teal
  class s0 bugPath
  class s1 blue
  class s1 bugPath
  class s2 blue
  class s2 bugPath
  class s3 teal
  class s3 bugPath
  class s4 teal
  class s4 bugPath
  class s5 teal
  class s5 bugPath
  class s6 teal
  class s6 bugPath
  class s6 repeats
